<title>UK: Quintain buys UK leaseholds for 5.5 mln stg.</title>
<headline>Quintain buys UK leaseholds for 5.5 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quintain Estates &amp; Development Plc said on Friday that it bought the head leasehold interest in two retail units from Storehouse Pension Schemes for 5.5 million stg in cash.</p>
<p>It said in a statement that the units, loctated at Dominions House, Queen Street in Cardiff, currently produce a combined rental income of 517,000 stg a year on leases which run until 2020 and 2015 respectively.</p>
<p>Quintain bought the freehold of Dominions House in September for 7.5 million stg.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
